  dir_target_err_late.pcpp - break step of dir_target.pcpp: @target after a
  conditional directive (the symbols it defines are already in use; it is not
  applied)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_target_err_late.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_target_err_late.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
